<h2 class="sec">Profile</h2>
<ul class="tight">
  <li>6 years of experience in software development, focused on full-stack web, .NET and Azure cloud engineering.</li>
  <li><b>Languages and frameworks:</b> C#, ASP.NET, ASP.NET MVC, ASP.NET Web API, ASP.NET Core, .NET 8/10, JavaScript, TypeScript, Python, HTML, CSS, jQuery, AJAX.</li>
  <li><b>Front-end and libraries:</b> React, Next.js, Vue.js, Angular, Flask, FastAPI, Entity Framework, DevExtreme, Redux, NgRx, Xamarin, Docker.</li>
  <li><b>Databases:</b> MS SQL Server, PostgreSQL, MySQL, Redis, LINQ.</li>
  <li><b>Azure:</b> Kubernetes Service (AKS), Functions, Data Factory, DevOps and CI/CD pipelines. Migrated production workloads from AWS to Azure.</li>
  <li><b>Applied machine learning:</b> logistic regression, feature weighting, model evaluation (AUC, precision, recall).</li>
</ul>

<h2 class="sec">Personal Qualification</h2>
<ul class="tight">
  <li>Take ownership of features from design through delivery.</li>
  <li>Strong interest in research, programming and system design.</li>
  <li>Work effectively both in a team and independently.</li>
  <li>Good at problem-solving and production troubleshooting.</li>
  <li>Able to communicate and work directly with US and Japanese clients in English.</li>
  <li>Willing to learn and adopt new technologies.</li>
  <li>Hard-working with a high sense of responsibility.</li>
</ul>

